  m_text: "Swedes have on average $57,000 saved in stocks.\nWhen deciding where you
    want your investments to be, \na multitude of factors play into the choice. \n\nDo
    you go with the safest option, which yields a lower return? \nOr do you gamble,
    with high risk and high reward? \nIs increasing your returns the highest priority,
    or is there \nanother angle to consider?\n \nIn this game, you will be faced
    with situations\n that\u2019s meant for you to question your choices, \nand visualize
    that actions do have consequences; \nboth immediate, but also long term.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c607bc552d27574281ceda981cb73ea, type: 2}
